# MansxBudget release keeps: MPAndroidChart uses reflection in animations/utils.
-keep class com.github.mikephil.charting.** { *; }
-dontwarn com.github.mikephil.charting.**
# Kotlin metadata (R8 handles most, keep annotation for safety).
-keep class kotlin.Metadata { *; }

